    "text": "In the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>LC</mi></math> circuit shown below, the current is in direction as shown and the charges on the capacitor plates have the sign as shown. At this instant<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0066_992c5013313b.jpg\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 127px;\" />"
