  "solution": {
    "text": "As clearly ‘<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>’ is increasing so electric field energy in capacitor must be increasing. And hence, magnetic field energy in inductor must be decreasing. So <math><mi>I</mi></math> is decreasing."
